# Active Agent Work - Compatibility Pointer

This file is retained during the generation 2 migration because existing installations and tools may still name it as an owner.

**Do not record new live execution or collision state here.**

Durable machine-readable mode, active Campaign/Slice, writer lease, integration branch, Exchange, relevant Agent Notes, owned paths, and checkpoint belong in `{{OWNER_executionState}}`.

Human-readable approved work belongs in `{{OWNER_currentTask}}`. Volatile online Action progress belongs in a mutable PR checkpoint; local progress belongs in ignored `.tova-runtime/` journals. Git retains exact history.
